[{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0010","text":"我想要的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0020","text":"────那种东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0030","text":"────抱歉，这种东西在学校里我都拒绝的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_9901","text":"同班同学"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0040","text":"不，我才该道歉……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_9902","text":"同班同学"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0050","text":"明明几乎没说过话\n突然要签名什么的，真的很抱歉"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_9903","text":"同班同学"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0060","text":"但是没想到同班同学在当偶像……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_9904","text":"同班同学"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0070","text":"不，我一直觉得樋口同学是个什么都能做到的人\n学习也好体育也好……经常听到你的名字"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_9905","text":"同班同学"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0080","text":"对吧，小时候经常这样吧？\n被人叫天才啊、神童什么的！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0090","text":"想要　　的东西　"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0100","text":"────那种　　东西　　　"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0110","text":"看起来像是　有吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_9906","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0120","text":"我先把你之前录的浅仓的歌声回放一下\n不用刻意模仿，先抓住感觉就好──…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_9907","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0130","text":"好──的，OK了\n樋口小姐，辛苦了──"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0140","text":"……辛苦了\n请问，接下来是轮到我了吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0150","text":"……嗯？ 我在"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_9908","text":"音响监督"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0160","text":"──休息之后，从斑鸠小姐开始……\n…………樋口小姐，之后也拜托啦！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0170","text":"那我先失陪了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0180","text":"喂……\n别去模仿别人啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0190","text":"歌我听了\n模仿得太过了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0200","text":"……是说唱法吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0210","text":"就是说……核心的部分…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0211","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0220","text":"有谁在就行了吧\n脑子里"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0230","text":"做自己就行了……\n──……反正也不可能变成别人……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0231","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0240","text":"……你才是\n你脑子里也有谁吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0250","text":"啊？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0260","text":"伸出手也得不到的东西\n或者……没能得到的东西"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0261","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0270","text":"……想找茬吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0280","text":"没那个意思"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0281","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0282","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0290","text":"……欧帕恰马啦多，欧帕恰马啦多"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0291","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0300","text":"──啊，这附近好像也有\n你看，小号教室！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0310","text":"然后呢？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0320","text":"？　如果遇到瓶颈的话，\n让别人教不是更快吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0330","text":"谁知道呢\n那家伙是想要自己钻研到底的类型吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0331","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0340","text":"就是那样故意绕远路、自找苦吃\n但如果不是那样，她就无法接受"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0350","text":"啊——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0360","text":"────樱木小姐也是来录节目的啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0370","text":"小糸酱和雏菜酱接下来也要去吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0380","text":"诶……\n啊……不……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0390","text":"雏菜们只是顺路来一下～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0400","text":"这样啊……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0401","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0410","text":"B录音室在哪个方向～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0420","text":"嗯，左边吧……？\n我在A录音室，所以就在这里……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0430","text":"好的～\n加油哦～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0431","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0440","text":"啊……\n那个…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0441","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0442","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0450","text":"哇，糖果……\n谢谢你……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0451","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0460","text":"────现在，我可以稍微进去一下吗～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0461","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0470","text":"录完了～？\n回去吧～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0480","text":"……啊，嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0481","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0482","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0490","text":"……你和斑鸠小姐独处了啊！\n要到签名了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0500","text":"我又不想要"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0510","text":"啊、咦？　是吗……\n但你明明在听她唱歌……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s43_03010000_04_0520","text":"圆香前辈之前还说要去问问能不能要签名呢～？"}]
